# DATE_RE live handoff

The only live handoff path is `research/daily-briefs/YYYY-MM-DD.md`.

The date segment must match `DATE_RE`: `^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$`.

Use Europe/Berlin for “today”. Create today’s brief if it is missing before other work.

`research/random-thoughts/`, knowledge pages, and chat history are not the live handoff.

**Uncommitted files are not shared memory.** Only committed git plus today’s brief count as handoff.
